Do not bake LLVM_BINARY_DIR into clingInterpreter

clingInterpreter was built with LLVM_PATH set to LLVM_BINARY_DIR,
which makes installed binaries look for Clang resources in the build
tree, e.g. <build>/lib/clang/<version>.

This breaks installed cling when the build directory is unavailable.

Remove the compile definition and rely on Clang's normal runtime
resource directory discovery instead.
